  "description_snippet": "Here is the growBuffer macro at parser.c:  \n  \n#define growBuffer(buffer, n) {\t\t\t\t\t\t\\  \n    xmlChar \\*tmp;\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\\  \n    buffer##_size \\*= 2;\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\\  \n    buffer##_size += n;\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\\  \n    printf(\"growBuffer new_size=%08x\\n\", buffer##_size);\t\t\\  \n    fflush(stdout);\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\\  \n    tmp = (xmlChar \\*)"
